{
  "format_version": 1,
  "id": "app.kepcup/im-wechat",
  "name": "微信",
  "icon": "icon.svg",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "把你的微信连接到 KepCup：在微信上给 Bot 发指令，Bot 的回复自动同步到你的微信。扫码即可添加，凭据只保存在本机。",
  "usage": "启用后还需要扫码添加微信账号（扩展中心 → 已安装 → 微信 →「管理」），并在 Bot 详情展开微信插件卡片勾选绑定；绑定后微信消息才能唤醒 Bot，勾选「同步消息到此微信」后 Bot 的回复才会转发回微信。",
  "author": {
    "name": "KepCup",
    "url": "https://kepcup.com"
  },
  "homepage": "https://kepcup.com",
  "engines": {
    "kepcup": ">=0.5.7"
  },
  "instances": [
    "im"
  ],
  "contributions": {
    "im": [
      {
        "id": "wechat",
        "label": "微信",
        "transport": "ilink",
        "apiBase": "https://ilinkai.weixin.qq.com",
        "setup": "qrcode",
        "features": {
          "inbound": true,
          "outbound": true,
          "media": [
            "text",
            "image",
            "voice",
            "file",
            "video"
          ]
        },
        "instanceFields": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
